    ],
    "reporter_page": "436"
   }
  ],
  "worker": "claude",
  "batch_id": "cycle-003-shard-01-batch-145",
  "notes": "Householder-tenant Mrs. Thompson's letting of a room to lodger Kirchner is treated matter-of-factly as an ordinary, unremarked arrangement entitled to ordinary landlord-negligence protections; the court never classifies the Thompson-Kirchner arrangement as lease/license/lodging, so characterization is left null.",
